{"name":"Starbright","hex":"#f5ecc9","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Starbright (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Starbright is a 2026 American fantasy film directed by Francesco Lucente and written by Joseph Bitonti and Olimpia Lucente. The film stars John Rhys-Davies, Diego Boneta, Alexandra Dowling, Ted Levine, Becky Ann Baker, Gbenga Akinnagbe, Tom Carey, and John Westley. The plot follows a young woman who discovers a fallen star and must protect it from dark forces that wish to exploit its power."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/a/a2/Starbright_%28film%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Starbright_(film)"},{"title":"Starbright (song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Starbright\" is a popular song written by Lee Pockriss and Paul Vance. It was recorded by Johnny Mathis in 1959 and charted in 1960."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/6/6c/MathisStarbright.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Starbright_(song)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/a/a2/Starbright_%28film%29.jpg/250px-Starbright_%28film%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/a/a2/Starbright_%28film%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/a/a2/Starbright_%28film%29.jpg/250px-Starbright_%28film%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AStarbright_(film).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/6/6c/MathisStarbright.jpg/250px-MathisStarbright.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/